.TH DOT 1 "2026-10-23" "dotfiles v0.2.537" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dot \- manage this machine, its shell, its agents and its configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dot
.I domain
.RI [ object ]
.I verb
.RI [ args ]
.br
.B dot help
.RI [ domain
.RI [ object ]
.IR verb ]
.br
.B dot help all
.br
.B dot help \-\-json
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dot
is the control plane for a chezmoi-managed dotfiles system. Its commands
are grouped into one-word domains, each a plugin with its own page,
.BR dot\-<domain> (1).
A domain or an object alone does its read-only default.
.PP
Every command accepts
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-h .
Run
.B dot help all
for every command,
.B dot help
.I term
to search, and
.B dot cli completion show
.I shell
for the completion script, generated from the same manifests as this page.
.SH DOMAINS
.SS Configuration
.TP
.BR dot\-config (1)
apply, diff and sync the dotfiles
.TP
.BR dot\-shell (1)
aliases, history, startup caches
.TP
.BR dot\-theme (1)
one palette for every app
.TP
.BR dot\-tool (1)
toolchains, packages, project templates
.SS Sessions
.TP
.BR dot\-session (1)
find, open and restore terminal sessions
.TP
.BR dot\-top (1)
what the machine and its agents are doing
.SS Agents
.TP
.BR dot\-ai (1)
install, route and run coding agents
.TP
.BR dot\-agent (1)
modes, policy, sandbox, budgets
.TP
.BR dot\-mcp (1)
MCP servers as supply chain
.SS System
.TP
.BR dot\-system (1)
updates, cleanup, scheduled maintenance
.TP
.BR dot\-doctor (1)
health, repair, backup and rollback
.SS Trust & hosts
.TP
.BR dot\-secret (1)
secrets, keys and SSH certificates
.TP
.BR dot\-security (1)
OS hardening
.TP
.BR dot\-attest (1)
attestation and verification
.TP
.BR dot\-fleet (1)
many hosts
.SS Platform
.TP
.BR dot\-cli (1)
plugins, updates, completions
.TP
.BR dot\-ui (1)
primitives for scripts
.SH FLAGS
These flags mean the same thing in every command that takes them.
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help for the command and exit 0
.TP
.B \-\-version, \-V
Print the version and exit 0
.TP
.B \-\-verbose, \-v
Raise the log level; repeatable
.TP
.B \-\-quiet, \-q
Print results only, no progress or logs
.TP
.B \-\-yes, \-y
Answer yes to every confirmation
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run, \-n
Show what would change and change nothing
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print the result as JSON with a versioned schema
.TP
.B \-\-plain
Print plain text without tables, colour or boxes
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Never print colour
.TP
.B \-\-force
Proceed past a safety check that would stop the command
.TP
.B \-\-no\-motion
Disable animation in a TUI
.SH SHORTCUTS
